[productization] Conditional productization (notstarted)
Files: product/**; crates/tools/**; crates/release/**
Do: Add only platform, packaging, content, audio/input, or tooling work shown to bind after the anchor evidence. Keep networking, merge, and final GPU choices deferred unless activated.
