[purity-hardening] Late compiler-checked purity (notstarted)
Files: crates/purity-tests/**; crates/engine-api/**
Do: After behavior and workload are known, narrow public boundaries with data-only DSL values, private constructors, forbid unsafe code, and trybuild compile-fail tests.
Accept: Prohibited mutation, callback injection, caller timestamps, and published-branch mutation are ill-typed while earlier conformance and benchmark evidence still passes.
-> productization
